WEBVTT

00:18.727 --> 00:19.894
For real?

00:35.493 --> 00:36.494
He…

00:36.578 --> 00:39.664
He did it! Tanjiro pushed the boulder!

00:39.748 --> 00:42.000
Shit! He beat me!

00:44.294 --> 00:46.337
It's just getting started.

00:46.421 --> 00:50.008
If I let up for a moment,
my strength will give out.

00:51.509 --> 00:54.929
I have to keep pushing the boulder
as long as I can.

00:55.764 --> 00:58.600
Don't use just arms, use legs and hips.

00:58.683 --> 01:00.393
Push with legs and hips!

01:00.477 --> 01:04.105
The lower body has more muscle mass
than the upper body.

01:13.281 --> 01:15.366
Tempura! Tempura!

01:15.450 --> 01:17.702
Boar Rush!

01:28.421 --> 01:31.049
Even Inosuke moved the boulder.

01:31.132 --> 01:32.592
This sucks!

01:32.675 --> 01:34.677
The only one left is me.

01:34.761 --> 01:36.346
This is the worst!

01:39.766 --> 01:42.560
Chuntaro? What's wrong?

01:42.644 --> 01:47.524
I still can't push the boulder,
so I can't move on to the next training.

01:47.607 --> 01:49.692
Don't rush me.

01:50.527 --> 01:52.320
It hurts! What's your problem?

01:54.781 --> 01:57.867
Huh? What? A letter for me?

01:59.327 --> 02:02.914
To you who is ignorant of
What eternity means

02:02.997 --> 02:06.209
It's time to show you the answer

02:06.292 --> 02:12.590
Beyond the endless spiral

02:21.307 --> 02:26.020
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA:
HASHIRA TRAINING ARC

02:28.398 --> 02:31.818
The reason why it sounded like an excuse

02:31.901 --> 02:35.363
A weakness that draws in a fleeting future

02:35.446 --> 02:40.577
You mistake it for strength

02:41.953 --> 02:43.788
So detestable, so detestable

02:43.872 --> 02:45.540
So disgraceful, so disgraceful

02:45.623 --> 02:48.918
The heart that is so bleak

02:49.002 --> 02:50.795
So dark, so dark

02:50.879 --> 02:52.755
That it almost hides the moon

02:52.839 --> 02:56.342
If only you weren't here

02:56.426 --> 02:59.929
It sways and sways

03:00.013 --> 03:03.558
Carrying on its intentions
Just like a flower

03:03.641 --> 03:06.936
Taking it all away, taking it all away

03:07.020 --> 03:10.440
It tears the heart just like a storm would

03:10.523 --> 03:14.027
To you who is ignorant of
What eternity means

03:14.110 --> 03:17.572
It's time to show you the answer

03:17.655 --> 03:22.952
Beyond the endless spiral

03:23.036 --> 03:27.165
Who awaits there

03:30.209 --> 03:35.006
EPISODE 7: GYOMEI HIMEJIMA
THE STONE HASHIRA

03:56.152 --> 03:59.781
I moved it… one cho.

04:00.949 --> 04:03.993
And that ends Himejima's…

04:04.077 --> 04:08.706
training.

04:11.167 --> 04:12.210
Huh?

04:13.044 --> 04:14.295
Wait, what?

04:15.129 --> 04:18.007
I… I'm dehydrated.

04:18.091 --> 04:22.971
I sweated like a waterfall
but didn't drink any water.

04:25.682 --> 04:31.813
Zen… Zenitsu, Inosuke, Murata.

04:33.147 --> 04:35.566
I think I'm gonna die here.

04:35.650 --> 04:38.695
Someone… help!

04:44.075 --> 04:45.576
Himejima?

04:45.660 --> 04:47.370
I'm saved.

04:47.453 --> 04:49.289
Namu Amida Butsu.

04:50.373 --> 04:52.166
Namu Amida Butsu.

04:53.126 --> 04:54.919
Namu Amida Butsu.

04:55.003 --> 04:56.754
Huh? Did I die?

04:58.006 --> 04:59.590
Oh! I'm alive.

05:00.341 --> 05:02.468
Thank… Thank you.

05:05.555 --> 05:08.141
You have completed the boulder training.

05:09.225 --> 05:12.812
Along with your righteous actions
in the village,

05:13.730 --> 05:15.898
I acknowledge you.

05:18.067 --> 05:19.110
In the village?

05:19.193 --> 05:22.363
Water… That's enough.

05:25.116 --> 05:27.618
In the Swordsmith Village,

05:27.702 --> 05:33.374
you prioritized saving the villagers
over the life of your demon sister.

05:33.458 --> 05:36.127
Oh, about that…

05:36.210 --> 05:38.421
Do not be ashamed.

05:38.504 --> 05:40.631
You are an exemplary swordsman.

05:42.258 --> 05:45.261
You should be proud of your right actions.

05:49.057 --> 05:50.725
No. You're wrong.

05:51.559 --> 05:54.771
It was Nezuko
who made that decision, not me.

05:55.897 --> 06:00.193
I couldn't decide
and almost let the villagers get killed.

06:01.694 --> 06:03.863
I don't deserve your acknowledgment.

06:15.416 --> 06:19.295
Children are pure, innocent and weak.

06:19.378 --> 06:24.050
They lie and commit mischief
without hesitation.

06:24.884 --> 06:27.136
They are the embodiment
of selfish desires.

06:28.346 --> 06:32.475
However, this child is different.

06:34.185 --> 06:38.648
No matter the circumstances,
I always want to take the right path,

06:39.440 --> 06:41.400
but I don't know what lies ahead.

06:42.235 --> 06:44.570
It's just that someone
has always helped me,

06:44.654 --> 06:47.824
and that's why I haven't made
any mistakes so far.

06:48.825 --> 06:51.702
It was really dangerous at that time.

06:56.457 --> 07:00.503
So please, don't acknowledge me
that easily!

07:00.586 --> 07:02.338
HARD-HEADED BOY

07:03.297 --> 07:04.882
Thank you for the water.

07:05.800 --> 07:08.136
And thank you for your training
until today.

07:08.219 --> 07:09.595
I have learned a lot.

07:11.514 --> 07:13.850
Now my doubts are gone.

07:13.933 --> 07:17.979
No matter what anyone says,
I will always acknowledge you,

07:19.021 --> 07:21.190
Tanjiro Kamado.

07:21.274 --> 07:24.110
Huh? I don't understand.

07:24.193 --> 07:25.778
But why?

07:26.988 --> 07:33.161
I used to raise orphans at a temple.

07:35.580 --> 07:38.082
Kazunori, you took so long.

07:38.166 --> 07:41.419
Sorry, I really needed to pee.

07:42.837 --> 07:45.882
Sensei, today's meal is such a luxury.

07:46.507 --> 07:50.178
Yes, I met a dried fish peddler today.

07:51.220 --> 07:54.474
He sold me the leftovers
for next to nothing.

07:55.850 --> 07:58.102
Let's be thankful for the kind person.

07:58.811 --> 08:03.274
Also, we should thank Ryotaro and Asami,
who are on kitchen duty.

08:03.357 --> 08:04.942
Yeah, thank us!

08:05.026 --> 08:06.694
Hey, Ryotaro!

08:10.865 --> 08:11.908
Sayo?

08:15.244 --> 08:16.412
What is the matter?

08:17.121 --> 08:19.832
You can have my fish.

08:20.708 --> 08:24.545
You're so thin. Please eat more.

08:27.715 --> 08:30.635
I see. What a kind child you are.

08:31.511 --> 08:33.429
While I appreciate your concern,

08:33.513 --> 08:37.725
I am used to rigorous training
and can endure hunger.

08:38.851 --> 08:41.562
You should eat it yourself, Sayo.

08:41.646 --> 08:42.730
Okay.

08:44.440 --> 08:47.652
Even so, I will not be outmatched
by you all in strength.

08:47.735 --> 08:49.654
Then I'll take it!

08:49.737 --> 08:53.032
No! It's only for Sensei!

08:55.576 --> 08:56.661
Oh, man!

09:01.832 --> 09:03.042
Thanks for the meal.

09:03.626 --> 09:05.253
Thanks for the meal!

09:06.170 --> 09:09.632
Even though we were not bound by blood,

09:09.715 --> 09:14.136
we lived together harmoniously,

09:14.220 --> 09:16.931
helping one another like a family.

09:18.349 --> 09:23.312
I always wanted to live my life that way.

09:25.606 --> 09:28.276
However, one night…

09:37.868 --> 09:40.121
There was a child
who did not follow the rules

09:40.204 --> 09:43.249
and did not return to the temple
by nightfall.

09:43.332 --> 09:45.418
He encountered a demon.

09:45.501 --> 09:47.670
To save himself,

09:47.753 --> 09:54.093
he told the demon to devour me and
the eight other children at the temple.

09:56.846 --> 09:59.432
-Good night!
-Good night!

10:06.522 --> 10:09.525
In the region where I lived,

10:09.609 --> 10:13.571
legends about the threat of demons
ran deep.

10:13.654 --> 10:18.159
We always burned wisteria flower incense
for protection every night.

10:20.703 --> 10:25.541
That child extinguished the incense

10:26.584 --> 10:29.962
and invited the demon into the temple.

10:42.433 --> 10:44.226
Who is it?

10:48.648 --> 10:50.900
Four children were killed immediately.

10:51.859 --> 10:54.945
I tried to protect the remaining four,

10:55.613 --> 10:57.948
but three of them

10:58.824 --> 11:01.702
did not listen to me.

11:08.793 --> 11:11.128
They ran without relying on me,

11:12.213 --> 11:14.882
and were killed
by having their throats slit.

11:16.342 --> 11:19.929
At that time, I did not eat much
because we lacked food.

11:20.012 --> 11:23.474
I was thin and weak-willed.

11:24.850 --> 11:27.311
I had never raised my voice.

11:28.729 --> 11:32.066
Furthermore, being a blind adult,

11:32.149 --> 11:36.862
the children must have decided
that I was useless.

11:38.197 --> 11:40.366
You're… blind?

11:41.242 --> 11:47.331
Only Sayo, the youngest, listened to me.

11:48.707 --> 11:52.211
Sayo alone hid behind me.

11:55.256 --> 11:56.757
I…

11:57.883 --> 12:02.471
I chose to fight,
determined to protect Sayo at all costs.

12:37.089 --> 12:41.051
The feeling of hitting
a living being was hell.

12:42.720 --> 12:46.849
I will never forget
that sickening sensation.

12:47.683 --> 12:53.063
It was the first time I swung punches
with all my strength.

12:53.856 --> 12:56.525
I myself was terrified by the power.

12:57.401 --> 12:59.403
Had I not been attacked by a demon,

12:59.487 --> 13:04.533
I would have lived my entire life
without knowing how strong I was.

13:05.659 --> 13:11.832
I kept smashing the demon's head
until dawn.

13:12.917 --> 13:19.131
That night, I lost so much, I was wounded,

13:20.174 --> 13:22.843
and risked my life to protect Sayo.

13:23.969 --> 13:28.891
Guess what she said
when people came to help.

13:29.558 --> 13:31.685
"That person is a monster."

13:31.769 --> 13:36.398
"Everyone was killed by that person."

13:37.733 --> 13:38.859
No way.

13:39.485 --> 13:43.072
She must have been terrified
and confused by what had happened.

13:43.155 --> 13:47.076
She was just a four-year-old child.
It's understandable.

13:48.077 --> 13:50.287
Children are like that.

13:51.914 --> 13:58.379
Even so, I wanted Sayo
to show me some appreciation.

13:59.380 --> 14:05.386
I wanted her to thank me
for fighting for her.

14:08.222 --> 14:11.684
Those words would have saved me.

14:12.893 --> 14:17.189
But children are always preoccupied
with themselves.

14:18.315 --> 14:21.569
The demon's corpse
turned to dust and vanished,

14:21.652 --> 14:25.114
leaving only the children's bodies.

14:26.365 --> 14:30.160
I was imprisoned for murder.

14:31.453 --> 14:34.206
Had it not been
for the Master's intervention,

14:34.290 --> 14:36.333
I would have been executed.

14:37.209 --> 14:41.630
Since then, I have become
a deeply distrustful person.

14:43.007 --> 14:45.467
Of course, I even doubted you.

14:46.385 --> 14:49.555
No matter how good a person appears to be,

14:49.638 --> 14:52.474
their true nature is revealed
in dire situations.

14:53.225 --> 14:58.439
But you did not run away,
you did not look away, you did not lie.

14:59.064 --> 15:00.941
You were honest and earnest.

15:02.276 --> 15:04.111
It might seem simple,

15:04.820 --> 15:08.324
but few can maintain such qualities
under any circumstance.

15:09.742 --> 15:12.036
You are a special child.

15:12.870 --> 15:17.541
I can say this after having seen
many people with the eyes of my heart.

15:18.250 --> 15:20.044
So I am certain.

15:27.051 --> 15:30.638
Everyone shares uneasiness
about the future.

15:31.639 --> 15:37.394
To ensure you do not lose your way,
I will help you from now on.

15:43.901 --> 15:45.110
I'll do my best.

15:46.070 --> 15:47.488
Thank you very much.

16:07.174 --> 16:09.593
You have finished your training with me.

16:11.387 --> 16:13.263
You have done well.

16:29.863 --> 16:33.283
Despite everything,
Himejima is a kind person.

16:35.411 --> 16:39.039
Because I don't have talent,
he wouldn't make me his Tsuguko,

16:39.748 --> 16:43.377
but he knew that I ate a demon
and made me his apprentice.

16:45.045 --> 16:49.174
He introduced me to Kocho
to get my body examined.

16:50.009 --> 16:52.094
Oh, that's the story, I see.

16:52.177 --> 16:55.055
Kocho gave me such a nasty look.

16:55.139 --> 16:57.391
Every time we meet, I get a lecture.

17:00.144 --> 17:03.814
Inosuke! That's Zenitsu's portion,
so you can't have it!

17:03.897 --> 17:07.484
Huh? If he's not here,
it means he doesn't need it.

17:07.568 --> 17:11.113
He's probably got an upset stomach
or something.

17:11.196 --> 17:15.576
Well, I think it's more likely
that he'll get hungry later.

17:16.827 --> 17:20.914
Geez, you're always worrying
about other people.

17:21.582 --> 17:25.461
You look pretty stubborn,
so I thought she'd lecture you too.

17:26.253 --> 17:28.756
But in the end, she didn't complain much.

17:29.298 --> 17:34.178
If I couldn't use breathing techniques,
I'd probably be the same as you.

17:34.887 --> 17:36.847
Is your body okay though?

17:37.514 --> 17:41.268
I'm sure that Shinobu
is worried about your condition.

17:41.935 --> 17:43.353
Do you think so?

17:43.437 --> 17:45.064
I bet, yeah.

17:45.147 --> 17:48.108
After having a meal,
I'm going to see Giyu.

17:48.192 --> 17:49.693
Want to go together?

17:49.777 --> 17:54.406
Even if I wanna, I can't.
I haven't moved the boulder one cho.

17:54.490 --> 17:56.742
I'm almost there!

17:56.825 --> 17:59.495
It's because I can't use
breathing techniques.

18:01.330 --> 18:05.000
You can't use breathing techniques?
What a small fry!

18:05.084 --> 18:08.045
-You are the small fry!
-The heck, bastard!

18:08.128 --> 18:09.588
-Damn you!
-Come here!

18:09.671 --> 18:11.131
Both of you, stop fighting!

18:12.174 --> 18:13.342
Get off me!

18:16.261 --> 18:19.848
I was thinking we could talk along the way
if we go together.

18:19.932 --> 18:21.225
About what?

18:21.308 --> 18:25.062
About your brother, the Wind Hashira.

18:26.814 --> 18:28.482
You know, actually, he's…

18:39.993 --> 18:42.913
Oh, Zenitsu! You're here.

18:44.123 --> 18:45.874
Have you moved the boulder?

18:47.209 --> 18:49.002
No, not yet.

18:50.129 --> 18:51.338
I see.

18:51.421 --> 18:53.924
I'm moving on to the next training.

18:54.591 --> 18:55.759
Are you all right?

18:55.843 --> 18:59.179
I'm worried because
you haven't been talking much lately.

19:00.848 --> 19:01.932
Is that so?

19:02.641 --> 19:03.684
Good for you.

19:04.560 --> 19:05.686
And good luck.

19:07.646 --> 19:08.814
I…

19:11.066 --> 19:15.737
I've just come to understand clearly
what I need to do, what I must do.

19:17.614 --> 19:19.241
What happened?

19:20.200 --> 19:22.870
-If there's anything I can help--
-Tanjiro.

19:25.164 --> 19:26.874
Just do what you need to do.

19:28.750 --> 19:32.045
But… But I'm worried.

19:41.054 --> 19:43.223
You're truly a good guy.

19:44.516 --> 19:45.601
Thank you.

19:48.478 --> 19:49.730
But still…

19:53.692 --> 19:57.154
This is something
I absolutely must do myself.

20:12.753 --> 20:15.130
Is Zenitsu going to be all right?

20:18.842 --> 20:23.388
And Nezuko, is it really okay
to leave her behind for so long?

20:26.141 --> 20:28.101
I wonder if she's feeling lonely.

20:29.519 --> 20:30.520
THOUSAND-YEAR BAMBOO FOREST

20:30.604 --> 20:33.273
Huh? I'm here…

20:33.857 --> 20:37.319
This should be the area
where Giyu is, right?

21:03.637 --> 21:05.222
So fast!

21:06.890 --> 21:11.728
Wind Breathing, First Form:
Dust Whirlwind Cutter!

21:11.812 --> 21:13.063
But…

21:17.359 --> 21:18.402
I can see them.

21:19.111 --> 21:20.821
I can follow their movements.

21:25.867 --> 21:27.786
Come on! What's the deal?

21:27.869 --> 21:31.540
Didn't you say
that you're different from us?

21:31.623 --> 21:33.959
I'm different from you all.

21:34.042 --> 21:36.920
Oh, no, that's not what he meant.

21:38.213 --> 21:39.298
Water Breathing,

21:40.173 --> 21:43.385
Fourth Form: Striking Tide.

21:43.468 --> 21:45.053
Too slow!

21:47.681 --> 21:50.767
Seventh Form: Drop Ripple Thrust.

21:50.851 --> 21:53.562
Fifth Form: Cold Mountain Wind!

21:59.359 --> 22:03.363
All right, then, how about we fight
to the death with our bare hands next?

22:03.447 --> 22:05.198
Wait! Wait! Wait!

22:05.282 --> 22:07.326
Hold on a second!

22:07.409 --> 22:09.328
You can't fight to the death!

22:09.411 --> 22:11.538
Shut up!

22:11.621 --> 22:14.082
Weren't you ordered to stay away from me?

22:14.166 --> 22:17.711
And you dare to sneak on us, you scum!

22:17.794 --> 22:20.047
Are you fighting over ohagi?

22:20.130 --> 22:24.468
If so, I can make enough to fill you up.

22:24.551 --> 22:27.554
You've got to be kidding me!

22:28.472 --> 22:30.974
Huh? No, no, I'm serious!

22:31.058 --> 22:34.186
You love ohagi, don't you?

22:34.269 --> 22:37.147
When I was training at your place,

22:37.230 --> 22:41.109
there was always a faint smell
of mochi and sweet red bean paste.

22:41.193 --> 22:42.861
What a nice smell.

22:45.989 --> 22:47.199
Every time you came back,

22:47.282 --> 22:49.618
I smelled the fragrance
of green tea and ohagi.

22:49.701 --> 22:50.952
So I was convinced.

22:52.829 --> 22:56.500
Shinazugawa… You like ohagi?

22:57.417 --> 22:59.795
Ohagi is delicious, right?

22:59.878 --> 23:02.422
Do you prefer it chunky or smooth?

23:02.506 --> 23:05.634
I too like ohagis made by my grandmother.

23:14.976 --> 23:16.895
Huh? What the…

23:16.978 --> 23:18.313
Giyu?

23:19.689 --> 23:22.901
Shinazugawa got angry
and went somewhere else.

23:23.985 --> 23:25.070
I see.

23:25.654 --> 23:27.447
Why were you fighting?

23:28.448 --> 23:31.201
We weren't.
It was part of the Hashira Training.

23:31.952 --> 23:34.579
The Hashiras are sparring with each other.

23:35.497 --> 23:36.915
Is that so?

23:37.666 --> 23:40.919
Oh! That's why you were
using wooden swords.

23:41.503 --> 23:43.171
Right, I get it now.

23:43.255 --> 23:45.298
Sorry I interrupted your training.

23:45.382 --> 23:47.175
No, you didn't.

23:48.051 --> 23:49.803
I wasn't able to speak well,

23:50.595 --> 23:53.098
and Shinazugawa was angry the whole time.

23:54.057 --> 23:56.893
But at least I learned
what his favorite food is.

23:58.061 --> 24:04.109
Next time, I'll keep an ohagi in my pocket
and give it to him when I see him.

24:04.192 --> 24:06.486
Oh! That's a great idea.

24:07.571 --> 24:10.448
I'm sure we can get along that way.

24:10.532 --> 24:12.200
I'll do that too!

24:12.284 --> 24:14.035
Don't do that, you fools.

24:20.667 --> 24:23.628
Where the hell
are those guys slacking off?

24:24.462 --> 24:28.717
Of all times,
both Iguro and Tokito are absent.

24:29.718 --> 24:34.347
Only training with those failures
will make me rusty.

24:34.431 --> 24:36.308
Are you fighting over ohagi?

24:37.684 --> 24:42.564
Tanjiro Kamado.
If that bastard hadn't interfered…

24:43.565 --> 24:44.774
Damn it!

24:45.609 --> 24:47.527
What's with that kid?

24:48.153 --> 24:50.906
He's totally nuts!

25:04.753 --> 25:09.216
FOUR

25:13.094 --> 25:15.764
What the heck is this?

25:26.733 --> 25:28.276
We've been infiltrated.

26:43.018 --> 26:47.314
The flame that burns heaven

26:47.397 --> 26:54.321
Truer than the truth

26:54.404 --> 26:58.366
The voice of prayers
And the sounds of shouting

26:58.450 --> 27:04.998
Are fleeting like winged insects

27:05.081 --> 27:09.627
Why do those who devour lives

27:09.711 --> 27:16.634
Beg mercy as if not knowing impurity

27:16.718 --> 27:22.766
Those souls that win through
The darkness can only reach

27:22.849 --> 27:27.604
Obtain that eternity

27:27.687 --> 27:33.276
There's a feeling here
That doesn't know demise

27:33.360 --> 27:38.615
Speak your dream, you strong one

27:38.698 --> 27:44.245
A resound congratulating tune of eternity

27:44.329 --> 27:50.001
Into the light that governs the sky

27:50.085 --> 27:54.255
In the corner of the world that is messy

27:54.339 --> 27:58.593
A blade of a sword
That still wriggles and resists

27:58.676 --> 28:04.599
Grovels and struggles miserably

28:10.855 --> 28:16.820
A stain from a worm being smashed

28:16.903 --> 28:21.366
Doesn't go away

28:21.449 --> 28:27.831
The only feeling left behind

28:27.914 --> 28:32.836
Doesn't ever disappear

28:32.919 --> 28:38.508
It snowslides to the bottom of the end

28:38.591 --> 28:41.553
The world roars

28:41.636 --> 28:45.724
At the end of a frozen future

28:45.807 --> 28:47.100
The lives

28:47.183 --> 28:48.643
The feelings

28:48.727 --> 28:54.816
Live on through an infinite time

29:02.657 --> 29:08.329
Destroy this demise, burn this destiny

29:08.413 --> 29:13.418
Scatter those powerless ones

29:13.501 --> 29:16.504
Hold eternity down

29:16.588 --> 29:19.299
The dreams of lives

29:19.382 --> 29:25.013
In the light eventually fill the sky

29:33.688 --> 29:38.943
Bow your head and yield the way

29:39.027 --> 29:45.867
Disturb the world

30:52.934 --> 30:55.353
Hey, you made it here.

30:59.983 --> 31:01.776
It's nice to meet you, right?

31:04.362 --> 31:07.031
Muzan Kibutsuji.

31:10.118 --> 31:16.666
What a hideous look you have, Ubuyashiki.

31:21.045 --> 31:22.046
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA:
HASHIRA TRAINING ARC NO. 7

31:22.630 --> 31:25.717
This time I'll tell you about Shinazugawa.

31:25.800 --> 31:27.510
What's this about?

31:27.594 --> 31:30.597
What's your business, Kamado?

31:30.680 --> 31:33.349
Well, it's not like I have some business.

31:33.433 --> 31:36.019
If you don't, then get lost!

31:39.355 --> 31:42.066
Let's start our Taisho period secret.

31:42.150 --> 31:45.361
Shinazugawa's hobby
is raising rhinoceros beetles.

31:45.445 --> 31:47.947
And his favorite food is ohagi.

31:48.031 --> 31:50.491
Ohagi?

31:50.575 --> 31:53.244
Again with the ohagi talk?

31:54.871 --> 31:57.957
Next up on the last episode:
"Hashiras, Assemble"

31:58.041 --> 31:59.459
Come back here!

31:59.542 --> 32:01.002
TO BE CONTINUED
